Clause 3(D): (D) Limits on number of licenses

(a) An individual / proprietor, partnership firm or Limited Liability Partnership shall be eligible for

only one license;

(b) Self-Help Group, Cooperative Society, Non-Government Organization / Society registered under

applicable law and Companies incorporated under the Companies Act, 2013 may be granted

licenses subject to:

(i) maximum of five Fair Price Shops per revenue district; or

(ii) such other overall ceiling as may be notified by the Government from time to time.

